      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FASCINATE SUZIE (1) turned in a plain run last time when sixth at Gosford over 603m behind Wreck It Rex (35.36) in a Grade 5. Reliable out of the boxes and should take advantage of the inside draw. Can make amends. COLD COLD NIGHT (7) missed the frame and was safely held latest finishing 8th at Wentworth Park following on from a second place finish (29.96) there the start prior. Has a strong record here at this journey including three wins. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. Bold showing expected. ZIPPING OSAKA (2) is progressing well with another good run last time, placing (23.09) last time out at this track. Expected to be in the finish again. BOY NAMED BLUE (3) cannot be ruled out.",
